---
import MainLayout from "../layout/MainLayout.astro";

const facts = [
  { label: "Based in", value: "Lemoyne, Pennsylvania" },
  { label: "Creator of", value: "The A.L.I.G.N. Framework" },
  { label: "Speaks in", value: "English and Spanish" },
  { label: "Trained through", value: "Les Brown's Speaking for a Living" },
  { label: "Works with", value: "Women, churches, and recovery communities" },
  { label: "Available", value: "In person nationwide, or on Zoom" },
];
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Angie Pichardo — Christian Speaker, Life Coach, A.L.I.G.N. Creator"
  description="About Angie Pichardo — Christian motivational speaker, life coach, and creator of the A.L.I.G.N. Framework. Suicide survivor turned purpose coach serving Lemoyne, PA and beyond."
  keywords={[
    "About Angie Pichardo",
    "Angie Pichardo biography",
    "A.L.I.G.N. Framework creator",
    "Christian life coach Pennsylvania",
    "Suicide survivor turned coach",
  ]}
>
  <div class="font-Grotesk w-full">
    <!-- Hero: headline, one promise, wide portrait -->
    <section class="bg-angie-noir text-angie-cream">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-28 md:pt-40 pb-12 md:pb-20">
        <div class="md:grid md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-14 md:items-end">
          <h1
            class="md:col-span-7 font-Frauce font-bold text-[clamp(2.5rem,7vw,5.5rem)] leading-[1.02] text-balance animate-rise"
          >
            You're still here for a reason.
          </h1>
          <div
            class="mt-6 md:mt-0 md:col-span-5 animate-rise"
            style="animation-delay:140ms"
          >
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-angie-cream/85">
              I'm a faith-based motivational speaker, life coach, and living proof
              that God can pull you out of the darkest places and give your life new
              meaning.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
              <a href="/#services" class="btn btn-light hover:animate-tada">Work with me</a>
              <a href="#story" class="link-arrow min-h-11 text-angie-cream">Read my story</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <img
          src="/images/about/angie-hero.webp"
          alt="Angie Pichardo looking toward a sunlit window, wearing a burgundy plaid blazer"
          width="2752"
          height="1536"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
          class="mt-10 md:mt-16 w-full aspect-4/3 md:aspect-21/9 object-cover rounded-lg animate-rise"
          style="object-position:62% 25%;animation-delay:260ms"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Story -->
    <section id="story" class="bg-angie-cream text-angie-noir py-16 md:py-28 scroll-mt-20">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 md:grid md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16">
        <div class="md:col-span-5">
          <div class="md:sticky md:top-28">
            <img
              src="/images/about/angie-aboutme-relaxed.webp"
              alt="Angie Pichardo smiling, seated in a green armchair"
              width="720"
              height="1080"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="w-full max-w-sm md:max-w-none mx-auto aspect-4/5 object-cover rounded-lg"
              style="object-position:50% 20%"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 md:mt-0 md:col-span-7">
          <h2 class="font-Frauce font-bold text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] text-balance">
            Why I get it.
          </h2>

          <div class="mt-8 measure text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-angie-noir/90 text-pretty">
            <p>
              I rebuilt my life after reaching the point of no return. There was a
              season where everything looked fine on the outside, but inside I was
              completely falling apart. Carrying depression, anxiety, alcohol,
              self-doubt, and the weight of not knowing my purpose, I reached a
              moment where giving up felt easier than keeping going. I was
              functioning, but I wasn't living.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="font-Frauce text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug text-angie-burgundy border-t border-angie-burgundy/30 pt-6 my-10">
              "I smiled in public and cried in private. I looked strong while
              secretly battling exhaustion, empty, and lost."
            </blockquote>

            <p>
              And then came the moment that changed everything. I survived what
              should have taken me out. In my lowest, darkest moment, when I felt
              like I had nothing left, God gave me what I can only call a second
              chance. He reminded me that my pain had purpose, my survival had
              meaning, and my life was never mine to throw away.
            </p>

            <p class="font-Grotesk-bold">
              That moment became the foundation of everything I do today.
            </p>

            <p>
              Through my A.L.I.G.N. Framework:
              <strong>A</strong>wareness, <strong>L</strong>ove Yourself,
              <strong>I</strong>nvite God In, <strong>G</strong>ratitude &amp; Growth,
              and <strong>N</strong>urture Positivity, I now help other women trade
              survival mode for the life God actually planned for them.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Facts -->
    <section class="bg-white text-angie-noir py-14 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 md:grid md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16">
        <h2 class="md:col-span-5 font-Frauce font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">
          A few things to know
        </h2>
        <dl class="mt-6 md:mt-0 md:col-span-7 border-b border-angie-noir/15">
          {
            facts.map((f) => (
              <div class="border-t border-angie-noir/15 py-4 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-6">
                <dt class="text-sm text-angie-noir/70 sm:pt-1">{f.label}</dt>
                <dd class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 sm:col-span-2 font-Grotesk-bold text-lg">{f.value}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing -->
    <section id="contact" class="bg-angie-wine text-angie-cream py-20 md:py-32 scroll-mt-20">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 md:grid md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16 md:items-end">
        <div class="md:col-span-7">
          <h2 class="font-Frauce font-bold text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] text-balance">
            Survived. Transformed. Purpose-driven.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-6 measure text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-angie-cream/85">
            Because God woke me up, but purpose keeps me going. And if you're
            reading this right now, I believe this with my whole heart:
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 font-Frauce text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug text-angie-rose">
            "You're still here for a reason, too."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-9 md:mt-0 md:col-span-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 md:justify-end">
          <a href="/#services" class="btn btn-light">Book a free discovery call</a>
          <a href="/#services" class="link-arrow min-h-11 text-angie-cream">Explore services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
